# ui patterns

- build interactive primitives in `components/ui/*.tsx` with `Radix` wrappers and `cn` from `lib/utils.ts`.
- keep layout wrappers consistent with `components/ui/card.tsx`, `dialog.tsx`, `sheet.tsx`, `dropdown-menu.tsx`, `tabs.tsx`, and `toast.tsx`.
- reuse aliases from `components.json`: `@/components`, `@/lib`, and `@/hooks`.
- mirror existing icon usage from `lucide-react` and state hooks from `react` in components like `components/dashboard/header.tsx` and `components/dashboard/mobile-nav.tsx`.
- keep local modal state patterns aligned with `components/tasks/case-modal.tsx`, `components/tasks/case-panel.tsx`, `components/calendar/event-modal.tsx`, `components/chat/chat-interface.tsx`, and `components/team/team-member-modal.tsx`.
